Z||000008||fiero56||11-13-1999||09:11 PM||||While we're on the topic of wheels and such, I say Fieros with painted calipers look sweet, with my favorites being red and yellow.  I laugh when I see the civics with painted rear drums, and wide open wheels allowing you to see the "mistake" of painting them.||||reg||7
Z||000009||Patrick||11-13-1999||09:20 PM||||<BR>I guess it's a matter of taste. I dislike painted calipers, unless they're painted black perhaps. I feel that any other colour takes away from the appearance of the wheel. And it's the wheel I want to admire, not a chunk of the braking apparatus. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||4
